{"availability":"available","full":"halvrenofviryel/hearthos","name":"hearthos","description":"Bounded-authority household AI for families. AI proposes; the responsible adult executes. Browser demo + policy gates.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-16T12:01:51Z","updated":"2026-09-12T11:23:53Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://phionyx.ai/hearthos","topics":["agpl-3","ai-governance","audit-trail","bounded-authority","deterministic","family-tech","household-ai","nextjs","parent-approval","policy-gates","reference-implementation","runtime-evidence","typescript"],"demo":"https://phionyx.ai/hearthos","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.390Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.390Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.390Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.390Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["HearthOS helps families turn daily chaos into clear routines, safe boundaries, and parent-approved decisions. Most AI assistants answer. HearthOS separates suggestion from authority — every output is a proposal; only the parent executes. Powered by bounded-authority AI orchestration.","🧭 Where this fits on phionyx.ai: HearthOS surfaces under phionyx.ai/bounded-authority as the household-scale demonstration of the bounded-authority pattern. The same primitives — scope, safety, ethics, state, approval, audit — appear at full fidelity across three distinct, separately-versioned upstream artefacts: the engine phionyx-core (the deterministic SDK; the 46-block canonical pipeline), the self-governance gate phionyx-pipeline-mcp (the MCP server that verifies an agent's own claims against git-diff truth), and the vendor-neutral AI Runtime Evidence Protocol (AIREP)…","HearthOS is a reference implementation of a bounded-authority household AI orchestration model: ten named agents, a three-tier policy engine (READ / PROPOSE / EXECUTE), explicit safety and approval gates, and a family-readable activity history. Built in TypeScript, runs offline by default with a deterministic mock LLM adapter, and ships a small public demo (Household Check / Weekly Reset / Boundary Script) that demonstrates the pattern in three minutes."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/hearthos/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3aaf4698db66048fab6e9559d904f2cd40ac5a451732d72c0ed76cd87fa95bf6","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.483Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.483Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"HearthOS helps families turn daily chaos into clear routines, safe boundaries, and parent-approved decisions. Most AI assistants answer. HearthOS separates suggestion from authority — every output is a proposal; only the parent executes. Powered by bounded-authority AI orchestration.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/hearthos/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No API key required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/hearthos/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3aaf4698db66048fab6e9559d904f2cd40ac5a451732d72c0ed76cd87fa95bf6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/hearthos/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.483Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-12T11:23:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/hearthos/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:03.484Z","hash":"3aaf4698db66048fab6e9559d904f2cd40ac5a451732d72c0ed76cd87fa95bf6","originalBytes":16116,"storedBytes":16116,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","hearthos","demo","pnpm","apps","audit","chat","core","filter","phionyx","list","public","runtime","activity","bounded-authority","console","gates","get","surfaces","three","does","engine","gate","plans","read","reference","deterministic","e